{"reviews":[{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-0","r":5.0,"t":"You definitely cannot beat the price on this kit! ...","x":"You definitely cannot beat the price on this kit! It comes with everything you need for hand foot and skin care. Will be ordering more to use as stocking stuffers for Christmas","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-1","r":3.0,"t":"Good kit, as long as you have another pair of tweezers","x":"This kit is full of items - I am not even sure what to do with half of them. The kit and the tools are well-made and attractive. The one flaw I have found is that the tweezers are too sharp; they cut hair rather than grab it. I am not sure of the purpose of tweezers in a grooming kit if I can't pull hairs with them.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-2","r":5.0,"t":"Thumbs up!","x":"Far higher quality than I expected!  Everything you need to take care of your nails in a very handsome case.  It's also small enough to fit in a purse or small bag","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-3","r":5.0,"t":"So pleased!","x":"I am so pleased with the quality of this set. It comes with everything one could possibly need. The tools are very nicely made & not cheap feeling. All of the cutting tools are nice & sharp. I am just very pleased. It comes in a brown leather-looking case that kind of looks like a clutch or wallet...or maybe even a chang purse. It could be gifted to a man as well, because with the color, it has a masculine touch. I really have enjoyed mine for months now!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-4","r":4.0,"t":"Great for the price","x":"Lots of pieces in this set that I will never use (some I wouldn't even know what to do with them). My only complaint is that they have a sanded finish to them which can make it feel like you're running your nail down a chalkboard.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-5","r":1.0,"t":"Stay Away","x":"Terrible workmanship. The smallest nail clipper broke during its first use. What a disappointment. My husband has a much older and similar set he bought at a flea market for a little less that is going strong without any issues.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-6","r":5.0,"t":"Very nice nail kit.","x":"This item would make a great stocking stuffer. It is well made, and very useful. And the price very reasonable for what you get.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great Value","x":"Tools work great. Hard to keep the case closed if everything is not just right inside,but for the price who cares?","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-8","r":5.0,"t":"Nice set for doing manicures & pedicures","x":"Good tools. Sharp cutting edges. Nice case. Not sure how to use some of the included tools.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-9","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"Good for the price.  Good quality but I have had better but at a higher price.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-10","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Don't waist your money! Tool tools broke with first use...","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-11","r":4.0,"t":"Nice set.","x":"It's as expected and a nice set for those on a budget. Tools have some weight to them and the whole kit is much heavier than I expected. Case is nice quality. Everything needs to fit exactly or case won't close. Even when everything is exact it still takes some smooshing to close.  Only 4 stars because getting the tools out is very difficult. I'll probably remove unwanted tools and just leave the few smaller ones I want loose in the case.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-12","r":2.0,"t":"case is junk","x":"clippers and such seem to be good but look a bit dirtyy like they've been used definitely have to disinfect before using, and the case they came in is quite crappy, out of the package it's coming apart. Part of my decision to order this product was because of the case and it's junk. definitely will think twice about ordering from this person/compnay in future","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-13","r":3.0,"t":"Cheaply made but inexpensive","x":"I can tell these are cheaply made - I would expect a smooth glide on the tools, especially the cuticle trimmer and nail cutters, but it feels like it grinds as I use the tool. The finish isn\u2019t fully polished. The tools feel rough around the edges.  Also an angled tweezer would have been better than the flat ones.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-14","r":3.0,"t":"It's good enough...","x":"It was pretty much what I was looking for, but the pack is a little bit ugly in color and feel and it was pretty big. If practicality is what you're looking for, then this works perfectly fine. If you want something smaller or something nicer to look at, then I would keep searching somewhere else.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-15","r":3.0,"t":"it was a good product for the price","x":"Honestly, it was a good product for the price. but the Clippers aren't good at all they aren't sharp and they don't cut nicely, I have used the cuticle clippers a lot and I like it, and the rest of the stuff to push my cuticles and all,  overall i am happy with it","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-16","r":1.0,"t":"Feels cheap and it started to fall apart. Loose ...","x":"Feels cheap and it started to fall apart. Loose parts. Doesn\u2019t cut well. I haven\u2019t used everything but the clippers and do far 1 cane apart & I had to put back together and the slanted tip one didn\u2019t cut my thin nails. I ended up grabbing the kids baby cutters.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-17","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent quality and quantity.","x":"I was not really expecting so many tools to be in the kit but I was pleasantly surprised. I bought 2 kits. One for myself and one for my boyfriend. He really liked the quality of the product and was really pleased at how well the tools performed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-18","r":4.0,"t":"Gets the job done","x":"A little cheap feeling but does the job. Clippers worked fine on my nails. Have yet to use other pieces. The case doesn't look much like what is pictured. It's all brown with a &#34;leather&#34; look.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-19","r":3.0,"t":"Serviceable manicure set.","x":"Tool are of lightweight construction and the case seems almost too small for the many pieces as closing it is often a challenge. Having said that, I got what I paid for.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-20","r":4.0,"t":"These are of pretty cheap quality but they all get the job done","x":"These are of pretty cheap quality but they all get the job done. The case is starting to fall apart a little bit but it still holds everything so I\u2019m happy.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-21","r":5.0,"t":"This is a great set for the price","x":"This is a great set for the price. Purchased several of these for graduating teens first apartment - perfect for a first &#34;real&#34; manicure set.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-22","r":4.0,"t":"Nice and sharp","x":"Super sharp, small clippers came apart, but I was able to put them back together. I like all the options. The case is very nice.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-23","r":5.0,"t":"so many uses","x":"i use this every week for various different reason. the variety in this little package can't be beat. worth a buy for sure!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B0711T3LDQ-24","r":5.0,"t":"Great product for the price","x":"Great product for the price. An extensive selection of grooming tools and even a nice carrying case. Couldn't ask for more.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the value and low price of the kit.","cites":[1,5,7,8,10,12]},{"text":"Many say the kit includes everything needed and the tools are well-made and sharp.","cites":[1,3,4,7,9]},{"text":"Several reviewers note they don't know what to do with some of the included tools.","cites":[2,5,9]},{"text":"Some report durability problems, with tools breaking on first use.","cites":[6,11]},{"text":"A few complain the case is hard to close or is poor quality.","cites":[8,12,13]}]},"qa":[]}